Value Filldown SEGMENT_TYPE (VLAN|BD)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value Required VNI (\d+)
Value MULTICAST_GROUP (\S+)
Value STATE (\S+)
Value MODE (L2CP|L3CP|L2DP)
Value SEGMENT (\d+)
Value CONFIG (\S+)
Value VRF (\S+)

# One record per VNI (vpn-fabric lab, IOS-XE 17). SEGMENT is the VLAN or bridge domain
# the header names (SEGMENT_TYPE).
Start
  ^Interface\s+VNI\s+Multicast-group\s+VNI state\s+Mode\s+${SEGMENT_TYPE}\s+cfg\s+vrf\s*$$
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${VNI}\s+${MULTICAST_GROUP}\s+${STATE}\s+${MODE}\s+${SEGMENT}\s+${CONFIG}\s+${VRF}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized show nve vni line"
